cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use docangle or the comparison in docs/05-comparison.md, please cite it as below and name the version and the commit."
title: "docangle: document page orientation and skew estimation"
type: software
version: 4.4.0
date-released: 2026-10-18
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "Kazim Mammadli"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KazimMammadli/docangle"
abstract: >-
  An open-source estimator of the rotation of a scanned or photographed Latin-script document page
  (angle in [-180, 180] degrees, confidence and a review flag), a controlled benchmark against other
  open-source orientation and skew tools, and a complete record of its design and evaluation.
keywords:
  - document analysis
  - page orientation
  - skew estimation
  - OCR preprocessing
